+| `react-dom` | `19.3.1` | MIT | `sha512-Y0bARz53lhEC1NMCASs0/j+faB/zqt3R8hpvg1e8+61ZVJ4UL0UdC4cBbXfZMcIuhrfgeILTLe+ZeBCavQPtKQ==` | DOM bindings for React 19 |
